# PulseBox Cyber Desk - Telegram Notification Configuration
#
# 1. Create a bot via @BotFather on Telegram (https://t.me/BotFather) to get your TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN
# 2. Retrieve your chat ID (e.g. from @userinfobot or https://api.telegram.org/bot<TOKEN>/getUpdates)
# 3. Copy this file to '.env' inside backend/ (never commit .env to Git) and fill in your values:
#
TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=
TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID=
